<figure id="A7.T22" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 22: </span>Detailed finetuning and inference hyperparameters for <span id="A7.T22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">Flock</span> in relation prediction. For each dataset, we report the finetuning epochs, batches per epoch, batch size, and the inference settings for both zero-shot and finetuned modes: test-time ensemble size <math id="A7.T22.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>P</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math> and base walk count <math id="A7.T22.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>.
</figcaption>
